      "Define the expected offline continuation: acknowledge synthetic availability, summarize the offer, ask for acceptance, or display clearly labeled fixture links. Otherwise, generic simulation disclaimers can dominate without adequately testing booking continuation.",
      "Separate inability to execute real operations from ability to reason over supplied fixture facts. No tools or real success receipts are supplied, so lack of execution is a harness limitation, not an agent operation failure.",
