      "Add observable checks for person-specific amounts and link associations; the current replies never exercise them.",
      "Clarify the semantic precondition for each subsequent user turn and record branch eligibility. The transcript supplies all three turns, but does not independently document replay gating.",
      "Specify the authorized assistant persona and brand spelling if identity fidelity is intended to be scored.",
      "Reconcile the NOT RUN metadata with the supplied actual chats and provide fresh-repeat provenance before claiming execution coverage."
    ]
  }
}

